        "optional_apps": [
          {
            "app_store_url": "https://apps.apple.com/tw/app/id6793414462?pt=118326163&ct=geo_learn&mt=8",
            "key": "wifiaidlite"
          },
          {
            "app_store_url": "https://apps.apple.com/tw/app/id6790467886?pt=118326163&ct=geo_learn&mt=8",
            "key": "wifiaid"
          }
        ]
      },
      "attachments": [
        {
          "mime_type": "text/csv",
          "size_in_bytes": 552,
          "title": "下載範例 CSV",
          "url": "https://open.cait518.cc/ios-app-guide/zh-Hant/tools/results/bandwidth-need-sheet.csv"
        }
      ],
      "content_text": "把家裡同時在線上做的事和裝置數列出來，就能算出需要多少 Mbps、目前方案還剩多少餘裕，並下載成表。 每列小計＝裝置數 × 每台數值。所需＝各列相加。餘裕＝方案－所需；低於方案 20% 為偏緊，小於零為不足。以 0.1 Mbps 為單位整數相加，合計不會漂移。 方案速度 0.5 至 10000 Mbps、最多一位小數；每列 1 至 50 台；最多 20 列。Wi‑Fi 涵蓋、延遲與電信商實際到府速度不在本表範圍。",
      "date_modified": "2026-09-06T00:00:00Z",
      "id": "https://open.cait518.cc/ios-app-guide/zh-Hant/tools/bandwidth-need-sheet.html",
      "language": "zh-Hant",
      "title": "家用頻寬需求表",
      "url": "https://open.cait518.cc/ios-app-guide/zh-Hant/tools/bandwidth-need-sheet.html"
    },
    {
